WEBVTT

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:01.420
Sponsored by Umemaru,

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.430
Matsu-

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.430
gorou

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.430
Cup

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.100
1st Annual

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.100
National High School Tsugaru Shamisen Koshien

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.100
Matsugorou Cup

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.100
Looking for Entrants!

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.100
Applications will be accepted on a first-come-first-served basis.
When all available slots are filled, we will close the application window.
Depending on the number of entrants, it may be possible to apply on
the day of the competition. Muster up your courage and enter.

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.110
the Tsugaru Shamisen Koshien:
The Matsugorou Cup!

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:07.650
It's perfect timing! Almost like
they knew we were forming a club!

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:11.270
So now we've got our members
and we've settled on a goal.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:13.660
Time to start practicing so we can win!

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:14.660
It's impossible.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.790
What did you say?!

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:20.570
I don't know how much you can improve
if you can't even produce a decent sound.

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:23.290
Do you plan on matching
Sawamura's style for the "Shinbushi"?

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:28.090
<i>You insist on having it all your own way.</i>

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.430
<i>But I won't let you do as you like.</i>

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.340
Kamiki Seiryuu and Sawamura's
ensemble performance...

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.430
...falls just within the
tournament's time limits!

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.850
Behold, children!

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.810
The Tsugaru Strait!

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.680
You see, just now, I wasn't
chasing the sound, I was riding it!

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:51.230
Sawamura-kun, your sound was
leaping so freely, it felt amazing!

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.920
Kaito gets Kamiki Seiryuu's one.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:57.450
Kaito's strong, and his
arms and wrists are steady,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.330
so I think he'll make this shamisen sing.

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:02.420
We did it, Shuri!
We played it with no mistakes!

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:04.080
I'm so glad...

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:21.550
<i>We're halfway through September
and it's still this hot?</i>

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:24.170
I can't take it.

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:26.640
Building Manager

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:26.640
Yamano

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.430
Setsu-san!

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:30.850
I packed you a lunch to take with you.

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:34.610
I can just buy some bread or whatever.
You don't need to bother.

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:37.610
It's not a bother.
I'm doing it because I want to.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.810
I've got school, so I can't make
today's group competition,

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:42.870
but I'll be rooting for you at tomorrow's
individual competition!

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:48.160
Thanks.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:52.840
Dinner is dad's specialty:
karaage fried chicken. You hear?

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.880
That's right! Give it your all out there!

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:59.900
And we'll do some fried mackerel,
kushikatsu skewers, and an omelet, too!

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:02.230
Isn't that too many sides?

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:05.070
You can do it! Take care!

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:07.870
<i>She's more like a mom than Umeko is.</i>

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:31.500
Those Snow White Notes

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:45.740
Episode 7
Wind

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.170
Matsugorou Cup
Competition Venue

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:52.440
This way, please!

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:53.830
Thank you for your cooperation!

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:54.790
Please come in.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:59.180
All participants, please go to the
counter over there to check in.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:01.520
Get your programs here!

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:04.930
Complimentary Umemaru brand
citrus sports drinks!

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.930
Drink these and do your
best out there, okay?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.090
It's so glamorous...

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:12.120
I thought it'd be quieter and more low-key.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.700
Don't freak out on us, Shuri.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.100
I'm totally cool with all this, of course.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:21.030
Really? Your legs seem to
be trembling quite a bit.

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.840
No way. I'm super looking
forward to this, really.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.950
Let's change into our uniforms.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.990
Uniforms?

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.710
A woman who always starts
with form: Yamazato Yui!

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.960
I prepared matching outforms!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.280
Oh, wow! You all look so good in them!

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.530
Very nice! You'll certainly stand out.

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:46.310
We stand out <i>too</i> much!

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:48.840
You could've at least made the colors match!

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:51.850
Rai-chan! We're here to cheer for you!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.190
Oh, the whole Handicrafts Club came!

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.330
Oh, Rai-chan, you look adorable!

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:57.610
Like you're from a sentai show!

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.770
But I <i>so</i> wouldn't be the yellow one, would I?

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.680
Do I look like a curry lover?

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.420
I mean, I don't hate it, but...

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:05.210
It's totally cute!

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:07.910
I really respect his
superior level of femininity.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:12.170
But I do feel like my nerves
have settled a little.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:13.250
Right?

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:17.000
Plus, we have Rai-senpai's handmade,
embellished yubisuri finger sliders!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.370
I've got my tortoiseshell bachi,
too. We're good to go!

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:20.210
Yeah!

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.760
Sponsored by Umemaru

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.760
1st Annual

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.760
National High School

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.760
Tsugaru Shamisen Koshien

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.760
Matsugorou Cup

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.760
Oh, yeah. Saying "my" reminded me
that Maimai should be here, too.

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:26.270
That girl you met through that game?

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:29.310
Yeah. I don't know what she
looks like, but I wanna go say hi.

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:31.680
Let's see. Aomori...

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:35.180
Tanuma
Mai

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:35.180
Aomori

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:33.430
Ah, this might be her.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.190
I think this "Tanuma Mai" is her.

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:37.390
You really are weird, you know that?

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:39.840
You only talked once online, right?

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:42.690
We chat back and forth on social media, too.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.520
You're gonna go talk to her?

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:46.010
If I can find her.

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:47.790
Or she might come looking for me.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.370
I'm going for a walk.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.140
What? It's almost time for
the opening ceremony.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:53.980
I don't need to be around for that.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:55.290
But...

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:00.300
Do you think he's nervous?

00:06:00.300 --> 00:06:02.800
Him? No way.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:07.760
<i>There's something going on between
Sawamura and Maimai! I just know it!</i>

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.330
SetsuSetsu.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:10.390
Maimai.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.990
SetsuSetsu.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:13.070
Maimai.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:15.440
<i>Were they sweethearts?</i>

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:20.690
<i>Oh! It's a secret of his that only I know!</i>

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.650
You. As her best friend,
you need to give her a talk.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.690
What?

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:35.040
Why aren't you gonna be in the
competition? I wanted to beat you!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.710
You keep running away!

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:39.040
That's why I can't get my father's approval!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.040
I'm not interested.

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.740
Gramps' sound is the only
thing I'm interested in.

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:56.260
You <i>have</i> to let me into tomorrow's
individual competition!

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:00.670
Um, I'm afraid we can't on such short notice.

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:03.860
This name <i>here</i>вЂ”Sawamura
SetsuвЂ”is someone I know!

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.060
He could've told me ahead of time, but he didn't.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:08.240
The entry deadline has passed.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:10.400
I placed second in an A-level competition!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:11.660
Can't you make an exception?

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:12.320
Mai!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.160
Mother...

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:16.830
Stop this.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:20.830
Deciding whether or not to enter based
on who else is competing is disgraceful.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.590
But... but...

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:24.170
That's right.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.910
There are no exceptions in my competition.

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:31.340
Using your achievements to get your way
only sullies the second place you got.

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:40.180
Umeko-san, isn't it?

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.930
And who might you be?

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:48.440
Tanuma Souichi and Mai are competing in this
tournament. I am their mother, Tanuma Sayuri.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:52.270
Which makes you the wife
of Kamiki Ryuugen, correct?

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:54.350
My, you're quite the beauty.

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:57.120
Did you get duped into marrying him because
you were inexperienced with men?

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:01.230
And you, so shrouded in mystery
that even your age is unknown...

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:04.410
Do you drink the blood of the young?

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.920
President, it's almost time
for the opening ceremonies.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.780
If you'll excuse me.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:17.280
Umeko-san. You said there
were no exceptions, correct?

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:20.270
That of course extends to your own son, yes?

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.610
Setsu has the talent to win.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.480
What are you suggesting I might do?

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:37.690
My Souichi has the talent to win, too.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.200
Well...

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:42.730
I look forward to seeing them.

00:08:58.430 --> 00:08:59.880
<i>This is fun.</i>

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:03.080
<i>I can hear shamisens being
played all over the place.</i>

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.520
<i>Their Bs are a bit sharp.</i>

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:08.890
<i>They're all playing it sharp.</i>

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:21.030
<i>Yeah. That fixed it.</i>

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:21.970
Thanks!

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:22.930
Sure thing.

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:23.790
Thank you!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:24.790
That really helped!

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:32.430
<i>The opening ceremonies will begin shortly.</i>

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:37.930
<i>All students and their guardians,
please gather in the performance hall.</i>

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:43.480
Reminds you of when you're
just starting out...

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.940
and you don't know how to tune.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:47.390
Right?

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:49.730
Huh?

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.050
Are you talking to me?

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:55.260
Well, if I wasn't, it would've meant
I was talking to myself really loud just now.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.470
I thought that's what you were doing.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:06.700
You're from Aomori!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:07.540
Yeah.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.550
So that means we're friends!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:13.800
No, it doesn't.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.850
Sawamura-kun isn't back yet.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:25.790
I'll go look for him over there.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.200
I'll come with!

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.350
Honestly, that idiot!

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.410
Where did he wander off to?

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:34.020
You're late!

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:40.190
Huh?! You got some kinda problem with me?

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:43.690
I-I wasn't glaring at you, I just... um...

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.140
Are you Yuiotsu-hime?

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:53.000
Maimai?

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.010
You look just as strong-willed as your avatar!

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:57.310
And you look just as condescending as yours.

00:10:57.610 --> 00:10:59.130
Y-Y-You shouldn't fightвЂ”

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:02.100
Hey! I was hoping I'd run into you!

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:04.250
So was I! I'm so happy!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.480
Umezono

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:08.480
Wait, are you from Umezono Academy?

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:09.960
Yeah. Why?

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.740
Where's Sawamura Setsu?

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:13.320
I'd love to know that myself.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:17.220
Anyway, what kind of relationship
do you have with Sawamura?

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:18.820
You're getting a kick out of this.

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:21.660
What? Oh, no, it's nothing like that.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:24.490
You're a troll, just like your avatar.

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.620
What about Maimai's goody two-shoes act?

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:28.840
Well, then!

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:30.750
<i>I knew it would turn out badly...</i>

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:36.250
No good. We couldn't find him.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:39.180
I wonder what happened to Sawamura-kun.

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:44.590
Maybe, deep down, he really hates
the thought of playing with us.

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:47.440
That can't be! That can't be it at all!

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:51.190
Not when we finally managed to be a team...

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:54.130
That can't be...

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:02.650
Oh, dear! Are you all still here?

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:04.320
It's already starting!

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:07.240
Come watch the opening
ceremonies, since we're here.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.050
Okay!

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:18.890
You're really on today,
Seiryuu-san! You nailed it!

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:20.570
I'm just doing what I always do.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:22.840
Oh, it's starting soon, isn't it?

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.050
You know. That high
school shamisen tournament.

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:30.860
I think they're streaming some of it
on the Umemaru Group's website.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:32.440
Huh?

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.460
The Tsugaru Shamisen Koshien:
The Matsugorou Cup...

00:12:52.670 --> 00:12:54.090
...starts now!

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.840
What's with this production?

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:02.900
It looks like it will be
an interesting tournament.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:09.050
<i>Group one. Ibaraki Prefecture,
mixed team: Mito-gumi.</i>

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:32.700
<i>Kanagawa Prefecture's Shotoku High School.</i>

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:47.160
Rock style, huh?

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:49.800
It's quite a creative performance.

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:54.520
No, no. That's no good at all!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:57.220
Attention-seekers like
them don't stand a chance!

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.980
You're one to talk, Ushio.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:04.170
The loud one over there is Arakawa Ushio.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.530
He's one of the ones to
watch in this tournament.

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:10.430
<i>Yokota Academy of Aichi Prefecture.
Team AYG.</i>

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:12.160
Let's go!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:35.550
My mood has tanked.
I'm gonna go powder my nose.

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:36.770
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:39.200
Another bunch of attention-seekers.

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.210
Nope. Nothing wrong with them.

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:42.110
What?

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:45.790
Thank you!

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:48.490
Wow. They're so cute.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.280
It'll be fine.

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:53.270
Don't worry. You're more
than cute enough, Kaji-kun.

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:54.620
What worries do you think I have?!

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.680
The team from Osaka Prefecture
led by Kaji Takaomi AKA Billiken-san,

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.210
is a real contender, too.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:01.880
Oh, my. He's kinda my type!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.300
But the person everyone's
watching out for is...

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:10.210
<i>Tanuma Souichi.</i>

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:13.640
<i>I've never been in any
competitions in Aomori.</i>

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:17.180
<i>So even though I know who he is,
he wouldn't know who I am, right?</i>

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.780
Kaji-kun, c'mon already!

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:20.180
Huh? Right!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:24.040
That performance was like Yogul.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.420
Hey, Yui-chan.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.820
Wanna go listen to the other teams play?

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.450
No way. I'm not going.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:37.070
Huh? Why not? We'd learn a lot.

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:38.960
At this point, there's no need.

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:40.960
Well, that's true.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:44.200
All we really want is to have
one last run-through...

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.540
How long's that damn Sawamura gonna be?

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:49.350
He's back!

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:52.620
You! Just how long were you
planning on wandering around?

00:15:52.620 --> 00:15:54.460
Don't leave me hanging like that!

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:56.250
We're on near the end, you know.

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:58.400
We want to practice right
up until we go on stage.

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:00.100
I don't.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.080
Huh?

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:02.520
The strings will go weird.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:04.980
You... Seriously?

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:09.070
I'm sick of you making
everything all about you!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.450
Think about us, too!

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:11.150
Kai-chan!

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.070
I'm not going to stop him.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:18.100
You're not motivated because
you're with three beginners, is that it?

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:20.740
You think it's impossible
for us to win, don't you?

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:23.690
Don't you? Answer me!

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:30.040
Why did you come?

00:16:30.470 --> 00:16:32.850
I came to see my mother.

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:34.180
Don't lie.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:37.230
Don't make Setsu suffer.

00:16:37.230 --> 00:16:39.970
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:42.790
Take it however you want.

00:16:45.840 --> 00:16:48.730
Hey! Answer me!

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:52.410
Why are you always like this,
hiding your true feelings from us?

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:57.450
If you think it's impossible for us
to win, just come out and say it!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:00.150
We're feeling desperate and nervous here.

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:01.790
We must look like idiots!

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:06.290
If you're not serious about this,
there's no point in doing it!

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.710
Kai-chan! That's enough already!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:12.590
If you don't want to do this,
we'll withdraw right now!

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:18.140
Ow!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:19.930
I'm not serious?

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:21.530
I think it's impossible?

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:23.400
Who are you to say what I think?!

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:27.880
The reason I can't practice right before we
compete is because I know my own quirks!

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:31.200
I want to win!

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:41.880
Wh-What's that?

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:47.820
Billiken-san!

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:49.450
Kaji-kun!

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:51.330
You can do it, Kaji-kun!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:54.030
Wow, listen to that cheering.

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:59.350
Let's see... Group ten, Osaka
Prefecture, mixed team: Billiken-san.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:44.480
<i>They're amazing! Everyone's perfectly
in sync. No one's missed a beat.</i>

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:48.970
<i>They aren't showy, but they are assured.
There is no deviation from the task at hand.</i>

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:52.190
<i>And no flaws in their postures, either.</i>

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.780
Kaji Takaomi.

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:25.100
They're really together.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.810
Huh? Yeah. They are, aren't they?

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:31.230
<i>Their sounds and the movement of
their hands are completely in unison.</i>

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:34.480
<i>They're like a well-trained marching band.</i>

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:08.880
<i>What is this?</i>

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:11.290
<i>Wind?</i>

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:33.100
<i>Wind... is rushing past.</i>

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:03.970
Tamago boro egg biscuits.

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:06.590
Th-They were amazing, weren't they?

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:08.680
Huh? Sawamura?

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:21.600
Seriously. What is it now?

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:23.850
Let me apologize on his behalf.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:27.210
Oh. Those distinctive features...

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:29.430
You're Sawamura's big brother, right?

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:34.600
Remember when he said earlier
that he knows "his own quirks"?

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:37.890
The way Setsu plays changes
depending on how he feels.

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:41.020
It sounds arrogant the way he says it,

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:43.930
but if you were to ask who he's
doing it for, it's for all of you.

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:48.110
If you were to ask why he's doing it,
it's because he wants to win.

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:52.520
I think he's emotionally
maxed out right now.

00:21:57.260 --> 00:22:01.880
<i>The wind is still rushing around inside me.</i>

00:22:03.850 --> 00:22:05.630
I want to win.

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:10.730
So do I.

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:14.470
I want to win, too.

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:20.520
S-So do I!

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:22.080
Of course we do.

00:22:22.080 --> 00:22:24.940
If you give up, that's
where the tournament ends.

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:32.590
Listen up.

00:22:33.110 --> 00:22:36.040
If you want me to give my best performance,

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:37.960
you're gonna have to carry me toward it.

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:39.220
Huh?

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:46.510
So in the end, he's still full of himself?
